<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
    <meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache">
    <meta http-equiv="Expires" content="0">
    <title>API List – Course Planner</title>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }
        .sidebar { width: 200px; background: #000; color: #fff; flex-shrink: 0; position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100vh; }
        .sidebar-title { background: #7a003c; color: #fff; padding: 18px 16px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: bold; }
        .sidebar nav a { display: block; padding: 12px 18px; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; }
        .sidebar nav a:hover { background: #7a003c; }
        .main { flex: 1; padding: 24px 28px; min-width: 0; }
        .page-title { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #7a003c; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 3px solid #7a003c; }
        .intro { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .intro p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #333; line-height: 1.5; }
        .api-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .api-table th { background: #7a003c; color: #fff; padding: 12px 14px; text-align: left; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .api-table td { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 0.9rem; vertical-align: top; }
        .api-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        .method { font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        .method.get { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }
        .method.post { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
        .path { font-family: monospace; color: #7a003c; }
        .usage { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555; margin-top: 6px; }
        .usage code { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { body { flex-direction: column; } .sidebar { display: none; } .main { padding: 14px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-title">Student<br>Course Planner</div>
    <nav>
        <a href="/">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/add">+Add course</a>
        <a href="/api-docs">API List</a>
    </nav>
</aside>
<div class="main">
    <h1 class="page-title">API List and Usage</h1>
    <div class="intro">
        <p><strong>How to view the list</strong> – Open the main page (<a href="/">/</a>) in your browser to see all registered courses. Use query parameters: <code>availability</code> (1 or 0), <code>sort</code> (course_code, course_name, course_type, rowid), and <code>order</code> (ASC or DESC) to filter and sort the list.</p>
        <p><strong>How to use</strong> – Each API below can be used via the browser address bar, link clicks, or form submission. POST endpoints are only called when you submit a form.</p>
    </div>
    <table class="api-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Method</th>
                <th>Path</th>
                <th>Description</th>
                <th>Usage</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {{#apiList}}
            <tr>
                <td><span class="method {{method}}">{{method}}</span></td>
                <td class="path">{{path}}</td>
                <td>{{description}}</td>
                <td><div class="usage">{{usage}}</div></td>
            </tr>
            {{/apiList}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
</body>
</html>
